(HANABI - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A cooperative card game. Players launch a fireworks show by playing cards of five) Tj T*
(colors in ascending order from 1 to 5. The twist: you hold your cards facing away from) Tj T*
(you, so you see everyone's cards except your own.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CARDS) Tj T*
(50 cards in 5 colors. Each color has three 1s, two 2s, two 3s, two 4s and one 5.) Tj T*
(There are 8 blue information tokens and 3 red fuse tokens.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(With 2 or 3 players each player gets 5 cards; with 4 or 5 players, 4 cards. Hold them) Tj T*
(so the other players can see them.) Tj T*
ET
