(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Do exactly one action:) Tj T*
(1. Give information: spend a blue token and tell one player either all cards of one) Tj T*
(   color in their) Tj T*
(   hand or all cards of one number in their hand. You must point to all matching) Tj T*
(   cards.) Tj T*
(2. Discard a card: put it in the discard pile, draw a new card and regain one blue) Tj T*
(   token.) Tj T*
(3. Play a card: if it continues a firework of its color \(for example a red 3 after the) Tj T*
(   red 2\),) Tj T*
(   place it. Otherwise discard it and lose one red fuse token. Draw a new card.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Completing a firework with its 5 gives back one blue token.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(- If the third red fuse token is lost, the game ends at once and the team loses.) Tj T*
(- If all five fireworks are complete, the team scores the maximum of 25 points.) Tj T*
(- When the deck runs out, each player plays one last turn.) Tj T*
(The score is the sum of the highest card of each firework.) Tj T*
ET
